{"ticker":"LYFT","updated":"2026-11-14T01:12:25Z","profile":{"longName":"Lyft, Inc.","shortName":"Lyft, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.lyft.com","fullTimeEmployees":3913,"marketCap":6416678400,"trailingPE":2.5192878,"forwardPE":8.117333,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.92880034,"pegRatio":0.15,"targetMeanPrice":19.37243,"targetHighPrice":30.0,"targetLowPrice":14.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.081,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.40015998,"operatingMargins":-0.02059,"profitMargins":0.40672,"totalRevenue":6908566016,"beta":2.058,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":23.73,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":12.46,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Lyft, Inc. operates multimodal transportation networks that offer access to various transportation options through platform and mobile based applications in the United States and internationally. The company facilitates peer-to-peer ridesharing by connecting drivers who have vehicles with riders who need a ride. It also operates Lyft Platform that provides a marketplace where drivers can be matched with riders via the Lyft mobile application. The company's platform provides a ridesharing marketplace that connects drivers with riders; Express Drive, a car rental program for drivers; and a network of shared bikes and scooters in various cities to address the needs of riders for short trips. In addition, it offers licensing and data access agreements; sells bikes and bike station software and hardware; and provides advertising services. The company was formerly known as Zimride, Inc. and changed its name to Lyft, Inc. in April 2013. Lyft, Inc. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Lyft, Inc. 經營多式聯運網路，透過平台和基於行動的應用程式在美國和國際上提供各種交通選擇。該公司透過將擁有車輛的司機與需要乘車的乘客聯繫起來，促進點對點的乘車共享。它還運營 Lyft 平台，該平台提供了一個市場，司機可以透過 Lyft 行動應用程式與乘客進行配對。該公司的平台提供了一個將司機與乘客聯繫起來的共乘市場； Express Drive，針對司機的汽車租賃計劃；並在各個城市建立共享單車和滑板車網路，滿足騎手短途出行的需求。此外，它還提供許可和數據存取協議；銷售自行車和自行車站軟體和硬體；並提供廣告服務。該公司前身為 Zimride, Inc.，於 2013 年 4 月更名為 Lyft, Inc.。 Lyft, Inc. 成立於 2007 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":18.83,"h":20.5,"l":18.77,"c":20.44,"v":25442600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":20.055,"h":20.255,"l":19.6,"c":20.19,"v":25554900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":23.38,"h":23.5,"l":21.91,"c":22.84,"v":101377100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":22.925,"h":22.97,"l":21.8,"c":21.96,"v":26073900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":22.36,"h":22.69,"l":21.935,"c":22.58,"v":28632100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":22.52,"h":23.04,"l":22.31,"c":22.63,"v":20632500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":22.64,"h":23.11,"l":22.05,"c":22.08,"v":21852400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":22.59,"h":22.87,"l":21.845,"c":22.06,"v":15144500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":21.89,"h":22.03,"l":21.3,"c":21.57,"v":13351500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":21.42,"h":21.93,"l":21.23,"c":21.87,"v":15159000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":21.91,"h":22.97,"l":21.69,"c":22.93,"v":24726800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":23.0,"h":23.28,"l":21.55,"c":22.01,"v":20016700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":21.98,"h":22.2,"l":21.74,"c":21.82,"v":11890400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":21.98,"h":22.705,"l":21.63,"c":22.61,"v":20501200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":22.575,"h":22.65,"l":21.83,"c":21.99,"v":18927800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":22.0,"h":22.48,"l":21.66,"c":21.74,"v":17447900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":21.74,"h":22.12,"l":20.62,"c":21.18,"v":16041500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":21.18,"h":21.437,"l":20.784,"c":21.16,"v":13936100},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":21.41,"h":21.48,"l":19.645,"c":19.72,"v":26771600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":19.665,"h":19.93,"l":18.855,"c":19.25,"v":18778800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":19.605,"h":20.03,"l":19.19,"c":19.99,"v":12582900},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":19.555,"h":20.59,"l":19.48,"c":20.13,"v":13907700},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":20.41,"h":20.729,"l":19.81,"c":20.0,"v":11131000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":20.18,"h":20.325,"l":19.62,"c":19.87,"v":12732900},{"t":"2025-10-17"